# Feature Modules

The application is divided into independent feature modules.

| Module | Responsibility |
|---------|---------------|
| AppModule | Root module |
| CoreModule | Singleton services, guards, interceptors, models |
| SharedModule | Reusable components, directives, and pipes |
| LayoutModule | Application layouts |
| HomeModule | Home page |
| ProductModule | Product listing & details |
| CartModule | Shopping cart |
| CheckoutModule | Billing, Shipping & Payment |
| OrderModule | Orders and Order Success |
| NotFoundModule | 404 Page |

